@startuml seq-llm-test
title Test connection

actor Lecturer
participant "Lecturer page" as UI
participant "HTTP API" as API
participant LLMClient as Client
participant "Provider HTTPS" as Provider

Lecturer -> UI : provider, model, key\npress Test connection
UI -> API : POST /api/llm/test\nX-Lecturer-Token
API -> Client : one short tool-calling request
Client -> Provider : header key, 8s timeout
alt 200 and a tool call
  Provider --> UI : status ok, tool calling supported, latency
else 200 and no tool call
  Provider --> UI : status ok, tool calling not supported
else 400 on tools, then a tiny completion works
  Provider --> UI : status ok, tool calling not supported
else 401
  Provider --> UI : category invalid_key
else 403 or 404
  Provider --> UI : category no_access
else 429
  Provider --> UI : category rate_limit
else timeout or network
  Provider --> UI : category timeout or network
else unknown provider name
  API --> UI : category unknown_provider\nno request sent
end
note right of API
  The key is not logged,
  not stored by this call,
  and not present in the JSON result.
end note
@enduml
